# qwen3.5:4b-64k — Qwen3.5 4B with a 64K context window baked in.
# This is the DEFAULT full-harness offline brain (2026-06-18). The 9B held the
# ~44-50K full-harness prompt fine on KV, but a cold prefill of that prompt on
# the 9B still took minutes before first token; the 4B prefills the same context
# several times faster, which is what makes `/model qwen` (and the `qwen`
# wrapper) actually usable WITH the harness loaded.
# 64K holds the full-harness prompt (~44-50K) with headroom. Native context is
# 256K, so 64K incurs NO rope-scaling penalty. Baked here (not via
# OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH) so the global 32768 default stays correct for the
# qwen2.5 coders.
# Build: ollama create qwen3.5:4b-64k -f modelfiles/qwen3.5-4b-64k.Modelfile
FROM qwen3.5:4b
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
